Subject: [PATCH 19/19] =?UTF-8?q?=E2=9C=A8=20feat(ui):=20keep=20the=20agen?=
 =?UTF-8?q?t=20mode=20switch=20on=20mobile?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Upstream moved the Agent/Chat switch into the Advanced Parameters sidebar, which mobile never mounts. Show the mode pill in the composer control bar on mobile so the mode stays switchable there.

Note: this is not a true MSM requirement. The pill exists only so the mode stays switchable on mobile, which the chat-mode behavior test needs. If upstream restores a mobile switch or offers any other way to change the mode on mobile, go back to the upstream implementation and drop this patch and its behavior test (mobile-mode-switch.spec.ts).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <claude@anthropic.com.invalid>
---
